cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Tropical Cover Crop Calculator"
abstract: >
  Open-source seed-rate, nitrogen-fixation, and climate-suitability calculators
  for tropical leguminous cover crops under oil palm, rubber, fruit-tree, and
  smallholder mixed cropping systems. Parameters sourced from MPOB Oil Palm
  Bulletin, RRIM rubber agronomy handbooks, Pertanika JTAS, PORIM bulletins,
  CIAT forage datasheets, and FAO Grassland Index.
